  "description": "<p>This inspirational faith floral area rug offers a blend of comfort and spiritual decor, designed to enhance various spaces with a touch of traditional elegance. It features a meaningful Christian design and provides a soft surface, making it suitable for both daily use and special occasions. The rug serves as a versatile accent piece, perfect for adding warmth and character to your home or church.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design for spiritual ambiance.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name or special message.</li>\n<li>Made with soft polyester fabric for a comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>Equipped with anti-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a variety of indoor settings and uses.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Entryways, Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Offices, Gamer Rooms, Reading Nooks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith, Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft polyester fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning, machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Vacuum, Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for enhancing the spiritual and interior atmosphere of entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, and even gamer rooms or cozy reading nooks. It is also well-suited for use as a prayer rug, meditation corner rug, or a decorative piece in a church setting.</p>",
